<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en" data-low-data="<%= user?.preferences?.lowData ? 'true' : 'false' %>"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" name="viewport"/><meta content="Classic Mart brings buyers, verified sellers and trusted promoters together in one responsive marketplace." name="description"/><meta content="#ff6200" name="theme-color"/><title>About Classic Mart — Classic Mart</title><link href="/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/storefront-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/shared-shell.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/marketplace-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/info-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body class="info-body"><a class="skip-link" href="#mainContent">Skip to content</a><%- include("partials/storefront-header") %><main class="info-main" id="mainContent"><section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="catalog-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><strong>About Classic Mart</strong></nav><span class="info-kicker">Marketplace built around clear choices</span><h1>About Classic Mart</h1><p>Classic Mart brings buyers, verified sellers and trusted promoters together in one responsive marketplace.</p></div></section><div class="container info-content"><div class="info-grid three"><article><h2>Clear discovery</h2><p>Search, categories and curated collections help shoppers compare products without unnecessary complexity.</p></article><article><h2>Trusted participation</h2><p>Seller and promoter profiles provide transparent specialties, ratings and marketplace history.</p></article><article><h2>Buyer support</h2><p>Order tracking, returns guidance and support pathways stay visible throughout the shopping journey.</p></article></div><section class="info-section"><h2>Our marketplace promise</h2><p>We design every step around understandable pricing, useful product information, secure checkout patterns and responsive support. Classic Mart validates catalogue, cart, order and payment state on the server; online payment entry is handled by the configured hosted provider.</p></section></div></main><section class="newsletter">
